  "details": "Already a week for many players from Russia there is a problem, because of which we have to play only with vpn. All people with this problem have one provider - МТС (MTS). I contacted the technical support provider and they told me that they can not help and I need to contact you. The problem is I am connecting to VRChat. I log into my account and upload to my home world. When I open the menu, I see how the list of online friends is updated, only for a very long time. But when entering another world, there is no download. So if I clean the cache, as I once was advised, then even when I log in to the account instead of my home world, I’ll come into the world with an error and request to log in again. Also I can not download content through unity.",
